                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ width: 176, height: 34, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>特质与计划</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#546779', marginTop: 4 }}>说明</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>两个页签的字段合起来，才是这个人物的完整资料。</Text>
